    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le r&#xe9;sultat escompt&#xe9; de ce projet consiste &#xe0; renforcer la capacit&#xe9; des autorit&#xe9;s judiciaires des &#xc9;tats membres &#xe0; ratifier les conventions juridiques qui r&#xe9;gissent la s&#xe9;curit&#xe9; nucl&#xe9;aire et &#xe0; y adh&#xe9;rer.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcome of this project includes a strengthened capacity of judicial officials in Member States to ratify and accede to the legal conventions that govern nuclear security.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
